OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters block roads in
OL,4,APortsmouth as 140 migrants rescued
OL,5,
OL,6,FHundreds of protesters gathered in
OL,7,FPortsmouth on Sunday night after around
OL,8,F140 migrants in a single dinghy were
OL,9,Frescued in the English Channel.
OL,11,FIn the second major anti-migrant
OL,12,Fprotest of the weekend, police faced
OL,13,Foff with demonstrators as they blocked
OL,14,Froads in an effort to stop the people
OL,15,Fwho had arrived on the small boat from
OL,16,Fleaving the city.
OL,23,APub: 06-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
