OL,3,GNEWSAProtesters block roads in
OL,4,APortsmouth as 140 migrants rescued
OL,5,
OL,6,FHampshire Police urged people to avoid
OL,7,Fthe Eastney Landing ferry port area,
OL,8,Fwhere the migrants were brought ashore,
OL,9,Fand said a dispersal order was in
OL,10,Fplace, meaning anyone failing to comply
OL,11,Fcould be arrested.
OL,13,FThe government condemned "the
OL,14,Fintimidating and thuggish behaviour" of
OL,15,Fthe protesters, many of whom were
OL,16,Fdressed in black and wore masks.
